# other (decisions/verdicts-track-current-tools.md). Change a pin and its line
# here together; the image build checks they agree.
#
# Each line must equal a whole line of the tool's probe output, trimmed: the
# rule verify.sh, the live suites and growth all apply. Capture it from the
# tool rather than typing it from memory.
